      "author": "Victoria Song",
      "publishedAt": "2026-09-23T23:37:17.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://platform.theverge.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2026/09/20260922_C0744.00_54_59_23.Still025-1.png?quality=90&strip=all&crop=0,3.4613147178592,100,93.077370564282",
      "originalUrl": "https://www.theverge.com/tech/999281/ray-ban-meta-audio-glasses-meta-connect-2026",
