      "body": "Your window to save up to $200 is closing fast. Current ticket pricing ends September 25 at 11:59 p.m. PT. After that, prices go up.\nAt TechCrunch Disrupt 2026, getting ahead means more than sitting in on great sessions. It means meeting the people you need to know, seeing what’s coming before it hits the mainstream, and getting practical insights you can put to work.\nRegister now to get up to $200 in ticket savings to one of the most anticipated tech conferences of the year. Save 30% more when you bring four or more with you.\nGet the edge at Disrupt\nTechCrunch Disrupt 2026 brings 10,000+ founders, investors, operators, and tech leaders together for three days of ideas, connections, and opportunities across the startup ecosystem.\nWith 250+ speakers covering 200+ sessions across six industry stages, roundtables, and breakouts, you’ll get practical insight into the forces changing how companies are built, funded, and scaled, from AI and robotics to fintech, infrastructure, and the future of work. But the value isn’t just onstage.\nMake the connections. Meet potential investors, clients, partners, hires, and collaborators through networking, including AI-powered matchmaking, ad hoc meetings, and the Deal Flow Café if you’re an investor or founder.\nStay ahead of the market. Hear how leaders are approaching the biggest strategic questions around AI, competitive advantage, fundraising, talent, go-to-market, and scaling.\nSee what’s next before it becomes obvious. Explore 300+ startups and breakthroughs in the Expo Hall, watch the intense pitch competition called Startup Battlefield 200, and discover emerging technologies across all sessions.\nLeave with something you can use. From fundraising strategies to GTM tactics and insights on building defensible companies in the AI era, Disrupt is built around actionable ideas, not just big conversations.\nSix days — then prices go up\nThe people you need to meet, the ideas you need to hear, and the opportunities you don’t want to miss will all be in San Francisco this October.\nJoin 10,000+ founders, VCs, and tech operators on October 13–15 at San Francisco. Get your ticket by September 25 at 11:59 p.m. PT and save up to $200 before prices rise. Save an additional 30% on group passes of four or more.\nImage Credits:Slava Blazer Photography / Flickr (opens in a new window)\nWhen you purchase through links in our articles, we may earn a small commission. This doesn’t affect our editorial independence.",
