      "id": "hackernews-2026-09-19-an-open-source-roguelike-adventure-through-dungeons",
      "title": "An open source roguelike adventure through dungeons",
      "summary": "Article URL: https://crawl.develz.org/\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49770809\nPoints: 55\n# Comments: 10",
      "body": "An open source roguelike adventure through dungeons filled with dangerous monsters in a quest to find the mystifyingly fabulous Orb of Zot.\nOr download for Windows, OS X, Android or Linux.\nLearnDB and monster Lookup: Look up monster stats and\nshort but up-to-date entries on game items & concepts\nCommunity Wiki: Non-official community-run DCSS wiki, with a focus on describing the stable release\nForum: Debate strategy and propose changes on our forums\nChat: Our official IRC channel is #crawl on libera.chat, containing many players as well as the Sequell infobot. The dev channel (#crawl-dev) can also be found on this server. Many players can also be found chatting in #dcss on the Roguelikes Discord, and Cerebot there is bridged to Sequell.\nBug reports: Found a problem? Let us know! We also still accept reports on the\nmantis tracker, but user registration is closed.\nCheck out the source code, and fork or contribute!",
