      "publishedAt": "2026-09-18T15:30:00.000Z",
      "imageUrl": "https://techcrunch.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/TCD26_Sykes-Khalil-16x9-Dark.png?resize=1200,675",
      "originalUrl": "https://techcrunch.com/2026/09/18/open-or-closed-ai-nvidias-nader-khalil-and-sydney-sykes-take-on-one-of-the-decisions-shaping-next-gen-startups-at-techcrunch-disrupt-2026/",
