      "id": "hackernews-2026-09-17-show-hn-i-built-a-new-version-of-my-fun-spatial-3d-online-me",
      "title": "Show HN: I built a new version of my fun spatial 3D online meeting app",
      "summary": "Hi HN!\nflat.social is a fun spatial online meeting app for remote teams and communities. It's largely built like a web multiplayer game, and the 3D virtual spaces are highly customisable with elements and activities (I recently added surfing!).\nLive demo to try it out: https://app.flat.social/f/demo-flat\nHere's a quick demo video: https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GeinBNqL23s\nIt's a solo, bootstrapp",
      "body": "Create a playful virtual space where your guests can walk up to each other, talk naturally and be together, right in the browser.Virtual HangoutMove around, bump into friends, and chat naturally with spatial audioSpatial AudioHear people louder as you get closer, just like in real lifeFun ActivitiesPlay games, do icebreakers, and bond with interactive activitiesCollaborationSketch on whiteboards and work side by side in shared spacesWebinars & ConferencesHost presentations with screen sharing and Q&ACustomizableDesign your own space with custom maps, branding, and room layoutsWhat the internet saysSpatial Audio & VideoAttendees are not chained to a grid of tiny squares like they would in a classic videoconference.Instead, they can move and gather in groups to talk with others around. Spontaneous creative moments are back in the game!Connect with a SmileFly around, bump into other attendees. Create new connections. Network casually and have fun!It's a digital cocktail party in a creative playground that is built like a multiplayer game. Everyone is an equal participant in a virtual world that is playful and promotes spontaneous conversations.Games & ActivitiesBuild a virtual venue for your next event or a digital office for your team where you can host events, happy hours, parties and team building activities.It's quick and simple: just select the room that you'd like to add or use one of the templates. Those can be mini-games, team building activities or something designed especially for your guests.Virtual EventsOnline PartiesFun Team MeetingsEvent Breakout RoomsDistance EducationNetworking SpacesOnline MeetupsLunch BreaksProject Kick-OffsBrainstormingVirtual EventsOnline PartiesFun Team MeetingsEvent Breakout RoomsDistance EducationNetworking SpacesOnline MeetupsLunch BreaksProject Kick-OffsBrainstormingRemote TeamsGive your distributed team a shared space that feels like an actual office. Drop by a colleague's desk, have watercooler chats, and keep the team spirit alive, no matter the timezone.Learn MoreOnline SchoolsTurn passive lectures into interactive classrooms. Students move between group activities, raise their hand to ask questions, and collaborate on projects, just like on a real campus.Learn MoreVirtual EventsHost conferences, meetups, and socials that people actually enjoy. Attendees mingle freely, visit booths, and join breakout sessions in a space that makes networking feel natural.Learn MoreYour virtual space is ready when you areSpin up a room in under a minute. No install, no credit card. Invite your team, students, or friends and just hit go.Get Started",
      "source": "Hacker News",
      "category": "tech",
      "tags": [],
